  "description": "This collection is designed from the independent VALUM contract report (Oct 12 2026). It intentionally expects status=99 to return 400 and may expose a missing enum validator. No task write endpoints exist yet; mixed task status and soft delete rely on xUnit integration tests. This suite INSERTS into the selected SQLite database. Use a dedicated disposable database and execute folders in order."
